{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:30 2026-11-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭｜姚子羚被拉入公廁暴打拍裸照  尺度大膽狂喊超屈辱  得罪林夏薇遭報復\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbda8c7598a88f9fec51b0cefae2d473/2026-11/ENT__1__0.png\"/>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》播出踏入第二周，劇情越趨緊湊。楊茜堯為追查殺害好友陳自瑤的真兇，不斷在林夏薇、姚子羚、傅嘉莉及鄺潔楹中尋找線索。繼早前陳自瑤被迷姦、鄺潔楹接客等爭議情節後，今晚播出的最新一集再度挑戰電視尺度，飾演金牌藝人經理人「藍鳳儀」的姚子羚慘遭擄走，拉入公廁暴打並強行拍下裸照，隨即引發網民熱議。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚遭擄走慘遭暴打</h2>\n<p>今集講述林夏薇得知早前的父女醜聞是由楊茜堯一手策劃，而姚子羚亦故意不壓下爆料，間接令新聞曝光。林夏薇在盛怒之下，唆使黑社會成員報復。劇照中，身穿深褐色大衣、戴著黑色貝雷帽的姚子羚在銀行提款後，一出門口即被多名戴黑手套的蒙面黑衣大漢強行掩嘴拖上車。黑幫隨後將車停在公廁附近，強行將她拉進狹窄的公廁內掌摑毆打，令她前額頓時受傷滲血。</p>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚於劇中性格奸險。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/075d9636fafa6ebc61578fd51f84008e/2026-11/1_14_36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚鮮有挑戰奸角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e14684512391d85105874c39cbcf042e/2026-11/2_2_57.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚造型硬朗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e201a1cdd9b01cb0295472dec514b8cf/2026-11/3_44.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚因得罪林夏薇而被擄走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba68ceafb948adaee156db51ec42b91f/2026-11/1_4_83.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚被拉入公廁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3128a421bf761398439d6d6465457a4b/2026-11/2_3_34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚被摑得撞牆流血。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32fe616d7c8714637319b34f610f7fac/2026-11/3_0_38.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚非常害怕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d4240927f35eddf0bbee8a2f5b04c25/2026-11/4_7_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚被強行脫衣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f151e7d334ee9c9537b28f1eab842c0f/2026-11/5_0_51.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚的遭遇極其屈辱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebd4664e53f6e53cfcf8e24a50c26bbd/2026-11/6_2_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚狂喊極絕望。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/069dad3c634eadbb0e40820a92ea393a/2026-11/7_2_33.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚演技大爆發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28814f5f137aa7559b2a78f32b7d850b/2026-11/8_1_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚於黑社會面前被脫衣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4b56fc5831a368a6e484a853841dbe8/2026-11/9_1_21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚演活羞愧絕望。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22cde8236e387de9e555b9e55cfe3c73/2026-11/10_0_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚衣衫不整暈倒在公廁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/384b0eae89554f4ba3c0d26a61e35225/2026-11/11_1_30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚被清潔阿姐發現。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57de8d10972495b84fa08b9c55867ad9/2026-11/12_30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚被送入醫院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9758ae839b186ae93da57872d4817205/2026-11/13_0_19.jpg\"/>\n<h2>姚子羚尺度大膽演活絕望</h2>\n<p>在強行脫衣及強拍裸照的橋段中，姚子羚被多名大漢強行扯開深色外套，露出內裡的黑色背心與白皙肩膀。面對施暴者的威脅，姚子羚毫無偶像包袱，將角色面對暴力的憤怒、尊嚴被踐踏的羞愧、面臨深淵的恐慌，以及對施暴者和命運的不甘演繹得淋漓盡致。特別是幾張她雙眼緊閉、聲嘶力竭狂喊，以及眼角噙淚、滿臉屈辱的特寫，層次感極強，令觀眾能深刻感受到那份窒息般的絕望。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚衣衫不整送院</h2>\n<p>姚子羚在慘遭暴打及強拍裸照後被黑幫擊暈，棄置於公廁內。直到翌日清晨，才被一名清潔女工發現。此時的姚子羚面色蒼白、額角流血，外套滑落露出半邊香肩，衣衫不整地癱坐於馬桶旁，畫面極其淒涼。她被送院治理後，躺在病床上眼神空洞、一臉木然，令人心疼。今集播出後，不少網民大讚姚子羚演技爆發，直言「連面部肌肉都在發抖，演得太逼真了」。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹接客激吻浴袍男：</h2>\n<img alt=\"騰訊視頻、極光TV全網提早在11月6日首播，TVB將於11月9日首播。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/738d16287e6df385e6ec547cb2685a6b/2026-11/001_1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹於劇中演惡毒的林安安。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ba9eecd78a8560ceab019617d3e46ce/2026-11/001_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹新劇《玫瑰戰爭》中表面天真無害，實質心機極重。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16f11ea2d99f95c0ce50e2e243b07215/2026-11/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹（右）與劇中一眾姊妹表面和睦，背後卻暗藏殺機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f9288f4bf28fcfcc0444d1187b42e60/2026-11/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹展現招牌甜美笑容，完美演繹笑面虎「林安安」一角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b11bb52c793d87a1cb9032f5712b08ce/2026-11/VS--1--myTVSUPER-17_55_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹飾演的林安安外出接客。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/397caf2a912bd5fcfd2cf968b0c27d17/2026-11/1_4_79.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹穿上肉色吊帶短裙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/578793ada602dab36af84b64f47a070f/2026-11/2_3_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹任由身材高大的「男客人」擺佈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1fc54e050f78f2e4072958f55070f92/2026-11/3_0_36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹眼神迷離。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bc0c487f1477e2cb5f1d49bf0b49db8/2026-11/4_7_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被攬實狂錫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f51c776969c8a65556e067b6d0e3927c/2026-11/5_0_49.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹一臉享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3f12429538c2ca2fefa713eef0bc002/2026-11/6_2_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被抱起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afaef949f0033804a3b4ac84582ae3c0/2026-11/7_2_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹眼神迷離。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d9e7f5d7741ef9bd81898abfa832eab/2026-11/8_1_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹跟男客人埋身肉搏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e05ff4a98c830445911221d1d011f38/2026-11/9_1_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被抬得老高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acd4fca6b3d735287b9d54867e173072/2026-11/10_0_34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被親雪白頸項。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffec27ba2fcdd7ccc1fbc6e9b6b20298/2026-11/11_1_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹演得放。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a90ab63ee640a5226ffe78b44f6d56b6/2026-11/12_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹接客過程被全面偷拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b2005ec81c2b3e20196904992bc5a34/2026-11/13_0_21.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T13:54:51.926610+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":723,"images":35,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:58:13.250441+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T13:48:18.194677+00:00","content_hash":"cf3bb0e71b75b0bc7c7c7309c17b6c4fdf93061a43b025055b0dc16eb8e03ea2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}